      "writtenOn": "2024-06-12T15:28:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If this code is no longer running asynchronously, do we need to use a temp buffer in `data`, or could this just be a local, or could the we write directly into `data-\u003einfo`?",
      "revId": "de0ec4393e9418248c1021ce32a5128ecfdfdf93",
