      "writtenOn": "2024-06-12T15:46:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure, we seem to only use the lock for foreign thread access to the `pdc_data_t` struct (i.e. `tps_post_command()`). `tps_get_info()` can touch `data` directly from a foreign thread, too, so that\u0027s why I added it. None of the internal command handlers running under the driver thread lock currently but we should think about that.",
      "parentUuid": "fa1e602c_11faff68",
